e 87 cartoon but  that's more have to do with  the comedic tone and the the tone of the  universe so the rest of it is  because it's a beat-em-up story-wise  you realize that you won't have the  real estate for huge huge scenes or a  lot of dialogue so  uh i  wrote it like a long chase scene or a  long fight scene where uh bad guys are  getting away with uh thingamajigs that  build up to a doomsday plot and the  turtles are always running after them  but then another big inspiration was uh  classic simpsons the arcade game but  also the show because back in the day  when the simpsons first started having  all these funny details in the  background was uh  like it warped my brain to pay attention  to what i was seeing so we put a lot of  these backgrounds a lot of stuff in the  background for the game lots of easter  eggs or just funny stuff for the game  but also  when you play the uh the arcade game of  the simpsons at the beginning of the  level something happens there's  animation someone  has kidnapped maggie or something  so  it makes every level its own little  episode so that was our main idea to  like  uh  give more of that character flavor to uh  each and every level that's fantastic so  every episode has sort of its own art  and in in into the overarching story  exactly um yeah that's one thing i  noticed that the background  it tells the story right and and the  thing that you mentioned with the foot  soldiers absolutely happy because the  foot soldiers are sort of like the  minions of the game where they're like  the fodders and you have to make them  interesting in every single any every  single way whether different colors or  just the comedic tone overtones that  they have yeah so one of the big things  in this  this original game is that we now have  an additional playable character yes we  have master shredder which i absolutely  adore and april which looks super  amazing  what when did you guys decide in the  process we're going to add these extra 