o thank you so much well thank you  thanks for coming um and i i can't wait  to see this game  so uh again  introduce yourself once again to the  crowd um and just let them know  more about the game when it's gonna come  out yeah uh so yeah i'm nick belzel i'm  the narrative uh designer at good games  uh tmnt shredders revenge is coming out  summer 2022 so that's pretty close uh  for for me it's almost uh right out the  door because we've been working on it  for so long wishlist now on steam  on steam uh write to your congressman  about it  uh uh talk about talk about it to your  mayor uh your clergyman whoever  we're looking forward i've been looking  at this game  see it throw and adding animations for  it and gameplay for it for two years i'm  super stoked to see  the fans  enjoy that lesson playing it like i was  watching you earlier uh looking at your  friend playing and i could see you  smiling under your mask i was like oh  that's that's what we're working for  that's that that's uh that's pretty good  that's why we come to  this is where we get to see these small  games come to life and again as someone  as a child of the 80s  these type of games are the ones that  speak to my heart and they are  absolutely you guys are doing such an  amazing job so once again we're here  with tribute games this is shredders  revenge coming out later this summer  this is lord sovereign for lords of  gaming.net and the ironworks podcast  you  [Music]

